title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › What the page shows
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: One verdict and the seven checks behind it. Reached by a row on the list, or when a live check finishes. The verdict banner holds the next-action buttons.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click a row on the list, or a live check finishes"
screen sc "Eligibility & Benefits\nTitle is the headline, for example 'Covered, but you need an authorization first.'\nSub 'R-1042 · J.M., 34 · Summit Medicaid HMO · Residential 3.5 · Date of service 10/21/2026'"
click b1 "Click '← Eligibility & Benefits' (back link, top left)"
goto g0 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › List › What the screen shows"

group gVer "Verdict banner"
  screen vb "Small caps 'Verdict'\nBig words: 'Cleared to bill', 'Authorization first' or 'Fix before billing'\nOne sentence why. Green, amber or red box"
  screen bt "Buttons on the right of the banner\n'Start authorization', 'Open case', 'Request retro-eligibility' ... 'Check again'"
endgroup

group gPay "Payment checks card"
  screen pc "'Every line has to pass for the clinic to be reimbursed'\nSeven rows, one chip each, then a line 'What the patient pays:'"
  decision q1 "Checked within the last hour?"
  process p1 "Pill reads 'Checked live at 10:42 am'"
  process p2 "Pill reads 'Last checked 10:40 am, 3 d ago'"
endgroup

group gAg "Agents card"
  screen ag "One row per agent\nVerify 'Eligibility with Ohio Medicaid' 0:03, Verify 'Benefits with Summit' 0:05\nCriteria 'Authorization rule' 0:02, Navigator 'Provider enrollment' 0:02"
  process p3 "Evergreen adds a row 'Phone call to Evergreen' 1:34"
  click k1 "Click an agent row"
  decision q2 "Was that row already open?"
  process p4 "Row closes"
  process p5 "Its answer opens under it, for example 'Coverage active, effective 01/01/2026, no end date'\nAny other open row closes"
endgroup

group gNext "Next checks card"
  screen nx "'Coverage again on 11/01, then every month'\n'Before each recertification'\n'3 days before the first claim'"
  process p6 "Same three lines for every patient\nNothing here is clickable"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Which verdict and why"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Payment checks: coverage, plan, service"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"

s1 --> sc
sc --> b1 --> g0
sc --> vb --> bt
vb -.-> g1
bt --> g3
sc --> pc
pc --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| p1
q1 -->|No| p2
pc -.-> g2
sc --> ag --> p3
ag --> k1 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| p4
q2 -->|No| p5
sc --> nx --> p6
